#: cauldron_optimizer/templates/manual.html:120
msgid ""
"Lo que cuesta elaborar esta receta: los puntos de hechicería de todos sus"
" ingredientes (y los diamantes de los premium), con el descuento de la "
"maravilla. Supone que los añades de mayor a menor cantidad."
msgstr ""
"What brewing this recipe costs: the Witch Points of all its ingredients "
"(and the diamonds of the premium ones), with the wonder's discount. It "
"assumes you add them from the largest amount to the smallest."

#: cauldron_optimizer/templates/manual.html:121
#: cauldron_optimizer/templates/results.html:170
msgid "Costes"
msgstr "Costs"

#: cauldron_optimizer/templates/manual.html:124
#: cauldron_optimizer/templates/results.html:45
